#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"
msgstr "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Free in-browser PDF accessibility scan (Matterhorn Protocol machine checks) and one-click PDF/UA-1 remediation via the "
"a11yfy service."
msgstr ""
"Analyse gratuite de l'accessibilité des fichiers PDF directement dans le navigateur (vérifications automatiques selon "
"le protocole Matterhorn) et correction en un clic conforme à la norme PDF/UA-1 via le service a11yfy."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy"
msgstr "a11yfy"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com"

